cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Seafolk, please cite it. The code in this repository is MIT;
  the published aggregates in dist/dataset (see docs/dataset-card.md) are
  CC BY 4.0, and the source data is the Danish Maritime Authority's open AIS
  archive (aisdata.ais.dk).
title: Seafolk — Danish AIS aggregates
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Burtsev
    given-names: Maksim
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-09-12'
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Maksim-Burtsev/seafolk
url: https://github.com/Maksim-Burtsev/seafolk
keywords:
  - AIS
  - maritime
  - Denmark
  - leisure boating
  - ferries
  - H3
# identifiers: a Zenodo concept DOI is minted by hand at first publish
# (scripts/publish.sh zenodo stops before publishing). Add it here, in
# docs/dataset-card.md and in README.md at the same time:
#   identifiers:
#     - type: doi
#       value: 10.5281/zenodo.<id>
